{159}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{160}{Leave us be, dog!}{Leave us be, wench!}{}{}{}{ }
{170}{Exactly. King Loghaire should be able to fill you in on the rest [the bitterness in his voice is barely disguised]. He was the one that they convinced to banish us! We were shocked, to say the least...but our king had spoken [he bows his head]. We were told our banishment was to the Isle of Despair, but this is where we ended up.}{Exactly. King Loghaire should be able to fill you in on the rest [the bitterness in his voice is barely disguised]. He was the one that they convinced to banish us! We were shocked, to say the least...but our king had spoken [he bows his head]. We were told our banishment was to the Isle of Despair, but this is where we ended up.}{}{}{}{ }
{171}{I can assure you, King Loghaire had no idea of their true intent.}{}{5}{}{180}{ }
{172}{Log Bare not not what they do to youse!}{}{-4}{}{180}{ }
{180}{[He thinks for a moment before responding.] Of course, you are right. Our King would never betray us, knowingly. [Loghaire nods, grimly, silently.]}{[He thinks for a moment before responding.] Of course, you are right. Our King would never betray us, knowingly. [Loghaire nods, grimly, silently.]}{}{}{}{ }
{181}{Continue with your tale, if you would.}{}{5}{}{90}{ }
{182}{Tell me moreses!}{}{-4}{}{90}{ }

